<article class="helios-journal-story"><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}?view=journal-world-of-helios-1">← World of Helios</a><h1>WHY DO OBJECTS ONLY TRULY BECOME MARKERS OF TIME AFTER LONG-TERM USE?</h1><div class="helios-journal-story__body rte">
         

<div>Table of Contents 
  
</div>
<div></div>
<div><p><span>A newly purchased item only brings temporary satisfaction; but an item that has endured through the years truly carries a soul and deserves to become a unique personal mark.</span></p>

<h2><span>The difference between an &quot;owned item&quot; and a &quot;companion&quot;</span></h2>
<p><span>When first bought from the store, all items are identical. Beautiful, but that beauty belongs to the design, to the craftsmanship.</span></p>
<p><span>Only when accompanying a man, going through every journey, do scratches and worn marks begin to appear, and then, they truly gain a soul.</span></p>
<div><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0644/2958/8701/files/g3_600x600.jpg?v=1780118998" alt="" loading="lazy" width="600" height="600"></div>
<p><span>Who doesn&#x27;t have scars? Scars are memories, and a mature man doesn&#x27;t hide his memories.</span></p>

<h2><span>Why do long-used items deserve to be a mark?</span></h2>
<p><span>Some items are bought out of fondness.</span></p>
<p><span>Some items are bought out of necessity.</span></p>
<p><span>But there are also items that, over time, become a part of their owner&#x27;s story.</span></p>
<p><span>They have scratches. They have changes that only the wearer notices.</span></p>
<p><span>But that&#x27;s what makes the item special.</span></p>
<div><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0644/2958/8701/files/6_1_5cd1b467-20e5-40d0-bd23-5afc4c0544cf_600x600.jpg?v=1780119037" alt="" loading="lazy" width="600" height="600"></div>

<h2><span>Unreplicable marks</span></h2>
<p><span>The special thing about time is that it creates unreplicable marks.</span></p>
<p><span>Because everyone has a different rhythm of life. A different journey. A different story.</span></p>
<p><span>And these traces of time turn an accessory into a unique version.</span></p>
<div><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0644/2958/8701/files/DSC9806_1_600x600.jpg?v=1780126504" alt="" loading="lazy" width="600" height="600"></div>

<p><b><span>Some things gain more soul as they age. A good item is one that stays with you through many stages.</span></b></p></div>
  

